{"1940870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Creator", "steam_appid": 1940870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3944370, 4050450, 4161280], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate interiors, decorate exteriors — paint, glue, and lay it all down: it’s time to impress everyone! Thousands of items are waiting to become part of your design projects. Submit your creations to the exhibition, earn awards, and gain recognition from the global design community. No limits, no stress — just pure creativity and inspiration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/5f0795167bcd6193d71b0775d1120284.poster.avif?t=1787925676\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/5f0795167bcd6193d71b0775d1120284.webm?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/5f0795167bcd6193d71b0775d1120284.mp4?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy the creative process without the hassle of searching for resources or the fear of making mistakes, as you craft stylish and cozy spaces in the most picturesque corners of the world.  <br>Use a variety of decor elements, furniture, plants, and landscape features to create unique interior and exterior designs.  <br>Choose styles, colors, and materials to your liking, filling locations with an atmosphere of comfort and harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/6bb712f564ddfa544384bd3d5c6913ec.poster.avif?t=1787925676\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/6bb712f564ddfa544384bd3d5c6913ec.webm?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/6bb712f564ddfa544384bd3d5c6913ec.mp4?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize cozy city apartments and residential homes of all kinds.  <br>Garages and various rooms offer space for your unique ideas.  <br>Enhance the setting with comfortable rest areas and functional elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/c2c5ed82edc8cdd4b02129f07a28d309.poster.avif?t=1787925676\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/c2c5ed82edc8cdd4b02129f07a28d309.webm?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/c2c5ed82edc8cdd4b02129f07a28d309.mp4?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Forget about resource hunting and constraints — focus entirely on beauty creation.  <br>Experiment freely, enjoying the process and finding perfect solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/125d8f0e36edd397200d45b182ee42ab.poster.avif?t=1787925676\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/125d8f0e36edd397200d45b182ee42ab.webm?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/125d8f0e36edd397200d45b182ee42ab.mp4?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Realistic day-night cycles and diverse weather conditions — from sunny days to thunderstorms with lightning — add depth and expressiveness to your creations. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/b70a03b32b611b38e412a077c1071e5f.poster.avif?t=1787925676\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/b70a03b32b611b38e412a077c1071e5f.webm?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/b70a03b32b611b38e412a077c1071e5f.mp4?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture stunning photos of your projects with a customizable photo mode featuring various filters.<br>Share your best shots with friends and the gaming community, drawing inspiration from others’ work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/7ab36ff32ea6195fd242f246c387f88c.poster.avif?t=1787925676\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/7ab36ff32ea6195fd242f246c387f88c.webm?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940870/extras/7ab36ff32ea6195fd242f246c387f88c.mp4?t=1787925676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate interiors, decorate exteriors — paint, glue, and lay it all down: it’s time to impress everyone! Thousands of items are waiting to become part of your design projects. Submit your creations to the ex